 class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://youtu.be/H0XssHL6ka4\" target=\"_blank\"> </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://youtu.be/H0XssHL6ka4\" target=\"_blank\"> https://youtu.be/H0XssHL6ka4 </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1311230-badassoverlord-s-assorted-homebrew-folder\" target=\"_blank\">Are you in the market for some Martial Arts? Perhaps some custom Artifacts for your campaign?</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10131-badassoverlord","name":"BadassOverlord","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10131_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"322"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-12T17:06:35-07:00","id":1380792,"title":"","content":"Ninja Scroll is mentioned 5 times in the 1e Corebook, so here's 5 ninja scroll fights.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=YanbRbNS5as\" target=\"_blank\">Fight 1</a><br /> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=t4AqQQ-efHY\" target=\"_blank\">Fight 2</a><br /> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=5jYbRscI0RU\" target=\"_blank\">Fight 3</a><br /> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=PfEQfcxy5Dk\" target=\"_blank\">Fight 4</a><br /> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=3_g3wpdyV1s\" target=\"_blank\">Fight 5</a><br /> <br /> Other mentions<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=9dY1Horc0T0&amp;t=79s\" target=\"_blank\">Crouching Tiger Hidden Dragon</a><br /> <a href=\"https://youtu.be/X5SaZ8EmSpw\" target=\"_blank\">Crouching Tiger Hidden Dragon 2</a> clip titled &quot;Invincible Sword Goddess.&quot;<br /> <a href=\"https://youtu.be/KXIJv1NoXmo\" target=\"_blank\">Crouching Tiget Hidden Dragon 3</a><br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=G2T_sNlLP0A\" target=\"_blank\">Street Fighter the Anime</a><br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://youtu.be/Jm6RtQAof4E?t=368\" target=\"_blank\">Thief by Looking Glass Studios</a>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1121-drlovemonkey","name":"DrLoveMonkey","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1121_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4736"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-12T17:44:36-07:00","id":1380804,"title":"","content":"I like Kegan Asura for some crazy and brutal MA and SMA action, I think that it has some inspiring fights<br /> <br /> (Though i only read the manga, unsure how it looked animated.)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#b22222\"><b>.</b></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3742-iceblade44","name":"Iceblade44","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"707"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-12T21:36:37-07:00","id":1380860,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Iceblade44</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1380088-best-fight-scenes-for-inspiration?p=1380804#post1380804\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I like Kegan Asura for some crazy and brutal MA and SMA action, I think that it has some inspiring fights<br /> <br /> (Though i only read the manga, unsure how it looked animated.)</div> </div> </div> </div><div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=yaRF5RIptYo\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=yaRF5RIptYo\" target=\"_blank\"> </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=yaRF5RIptYo\" target=\"_blank\"> https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=yaRF5RIptYo </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div><br /> Setsuna vs Ren as an example.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=yaRF5RIptYo\" target=\"_blank\">-</a>---<br /> <br /> Sephiroth vs Cloud: <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=3ws7BeK6DS0&amp;t=183s\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=3ws7BeK6DS0&amp;t=183s</a><br /> <br /> Tifa vs Loz <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=k70IWHiXl18\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=k70IWHiXl18</a><br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25210-heavenly-devil","name":"Heavenly Devil","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25210_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-13T04:01:37-07:00","id":1380898,"title":"","content":"Whole Devil May Cry series is Exalted AF. I strongly suggest playing the game to anyone who wants to see how good exalted fights should look like. My two favourites are DMC4 and DMC 5<br /> <br /> Few highlights DMC4:<br /> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Si0JnSlG-7s\" target=\"_blank\">Nero vs. Berial</a> (1:34 shows great Heavenly Guardian Defense btw) <br /> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=vHSQdLSs6Z4\" target=\"_blank\">Nero vs Credo </a><br /> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=7ChsXkjrQTM\" target=\"_blank\">Nero vs Dante</a> - two skilled exalted fighters fighting each other<br /> <a href=\"http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=xSoGOJjNdLI\" target=\"_blank\">Dante vs. Berial</a> <br /> <br /> Also Devil May Cry 5:<br /> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=2BN_tuOkMyI\" target=\"_blank\">Dante vs. Vergil</a> - skilled exaltes fighting each other again<br /> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Giqhg9GIPSg\" target=\"_blank\">Nero vs. Goliath</a> - or how do you slay a behemoth<br /> <br /> More to come!<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2637-qendi","name":"qendi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2637_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"49"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-13T04:14:42-07:00","id":1380901,"title":"","content":"Another game series that is Exalted AF - God of War. Again, few highlights from my personal favourite the latest God of War (2018)<br /> <br /> <div class=\"videocontainer with-aspect-ratio videocontainer-horizontal\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 16/9;\"> <a class=\"video-frame\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=w_a4U0aymmM\" data-code=\"w_a4U0aymmM\" data-provider=\"youtube\" data-height=\"0\" data-width=\"0\" itemprop=\"video\"> <div class=\"videothumbnail\" style=\"\"> <img src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/w_a4U0aymmM/maxresdefault.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <div class=\"videothumbnailoverlay\"></div> </div> </a> </div><br /> <br /> and another one<br /> <br /> <div class=\"videocontainer with-aspect-ratio videocontainer-horizontal\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 16/9;\"> <a class=\"video-frame\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ojtoUxN9KH8\" data-code=\"ojtoUxN9KH8\" data-provider=\"youtube\" data-height=\"0\" data-width=\"0\" itemprop=\"video\"> <div class=\"videothumbnail\" style=\"\"> <img src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/ojtoUxN9KH8/maxresdefault.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <div class=\"videothumbnailoverlay\"></div> </div> </a> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2637-qendi","name":"qendi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2637_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"49"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-13T04:25:10-07:00","id":1380902,"title":"","content":"This time an anime that's I think mentioned already in Exalted inspirations - <b>Bleach</b>. One of the best sources of cool, over-the-top and incredibly epic fights. Again some highlights:<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=xcQdpd0OvwA\" target=\"_blank\">Ichigo vs Uluquiorra</a><br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ZwnAf-NbNKo\" target=\"_blank\">Ichigo vs Grimmjow</a><br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=1nyt-kV04uM\" target=\"_blank\">Toshiro vs Gin</a> (you can easily start watching around 3:00)<br /> <br /> more to come!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2637-qendi","name":"qendi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2637_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"49"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-13T13:32:36-07:00","id":1381077,"title":"","content":"Already posted an Avatar clip, apologies, but this 'un feels appropriate too. Avatar's generally your go to for DBs, but this puts me in mind of a Solar desperately trying not to flare: <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=LlJf8sSqoI8\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=LlJf8sSqoI8</a><br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24647-moss-reynholm","name":"Moss Reynholm","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24647_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"223"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-13T16:59:45-07:00","id":1381141,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Moss Reynholm</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1380088-best-fight-scenes-for-inspiration?p=1381077#post1381077\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Already posted an Avatar clip, apologies, but this 'un feels appropriate too. Avatar's generally your go to for DBs, but this puts me in mind of a Solar desperately trying not to flare: <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=LlJf8sSqoI8\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=LlJf8sSqoI8</a></div> </div> </div> </div>1. I want whatever steel those swords are made of that they can deflect 60kg rocks.<br /> 2. I didn't know firebending could be used with twinblades. Awesome.<br /> 3. In spite of the fact that Zuko is a twinblade fire martial artist there, that ending where he beats the bad guys, and then the people he was protecting say that hate him and kick him out in his straw hat to ride into the sunset is painfully Solar.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1121-drlovemonkey","name":"DrLoveMonkey","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1121_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4736"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-14T11:35:13-07:00","id":1381383,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://youtu.be/B_QZ3w31v5Y\" target=\"_blank\">Twin Star Exorcists - Benio is totally a Sidereal.</a><br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://youtu.be/R4PFOBNn2rE\" target=\"_blank\">The various Fate anime have a lot of excellent Exalted-esque fights, this being my favorite.</a><br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://youtu.be/INKPXZbaZaA\" target=\"_blank\">Lots of good fights in Hero, particularly the Donnie Yen/Jet Li fight.</a><br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://youtu.be/5rTfymEjEz0\" target=\"_blank\">And since I'm sure a Zhang Yimou stan, here's one from House of Flying Daggers, as well.</a><br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://youtu.be/SoV0YXe5YJ0\" target=\"_blank\">If you can get over the fact that it's puppets, there are some great fights in Thunderbolt Fantasy.</a>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/794-el-pinko-grande","name":"el pinko grande","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar794_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-22T20:11:50-07:00","id":1383278,"title":"","content":"Wasn't sure where else to put this, it didn't seem like it warranted it's own thread, but for some reason I feel the need to play a <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=B_cX1SwiC1Y\" target=\"_blank\">Prasadi True Way Air Immaculate</a>.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1121-drlovemonkey","name":"DrLoveMonkey","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1121_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4736"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-23T07:36:15-07:00","id":1383364,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>el pinko grande</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1380088-best-fight-scenes-for-inspiration?p=1381383#post1381383\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><a href=\"https://youtu.be/SoV0YXe5YJ0\" target=\"_blank\">If you can get over the fact that it's puppets, there are some great fights in Thunderbolt Fantasy.</a></div> </div> </div> </div>I came here to post #3. Someone posted a webm of it with the filename &quot;ExaltedCombat.webm&quot; and that was what made me interested in Exalted in the first place.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12738-minty","name":"Minty","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"222"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-27T20:02:29-07:00","id":1384342,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=-43wmSEpK3c\" target=\"_blank\">Trevor and Sypha</a> fighting demons in <i>Castlevania</i> season 3. It's got almost everything Exalted: A chosen hero using a blessed Artifact that deals aggravated damage to Creatures of Darkness. A scholar blending control of the elements with kung fu. A Sorcerer interrupting a demonic ritual in a Demesne. A blood sacrifice to summon a Deathlord from the Underworld. Great stunts, great fights. <br /> <br /> Season 2 has <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=22lIKww32iQ\" target=\"_blank\">three heroes taking on a Deathlord</a>. Alucard, Trevor, and Sypha are basically an Abyssal, a Heroic Mortal, and a Dragonblood. Alucard is simply more powerful than Trevor and is much faster, but Trevor has an Artifact and a ton of tricks from countless battles. Sypha has elements magic and martial arts. <br /> <br /> Cho demonstrates how <i>terrifying</i> it is to battle a master of an Exalted Martial Art, and in this case its also a flawless representation of<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=rBXo9IkSEHI\" target=\"_blank\"> Pearl Courtesan</a>!<br /> <br /> The Morningstar Flail (Trevor's Whip) and Sword Familiar (Alucard's Sword) are both amazing examples of artifacts that going in completely different directions. The Whip deals aggravated damage to Creatures of Darkness and extra to vampires, and it makes them <i><b>explode</b>, </i>while the Sword can defend or attack on its own. <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Q_EOHqTwl5s\" target=\"_blank\">Watch them attack a battlegroup</a> (a Might 2, Elite Drill, Size 2 group at that). Dracula serves as a perfect Deathlord- he has mastered dark science, powerful sorcery, and has enough Brawl, Resistance, and Presence that its insane to even think about opposing him. His Castle is a Manse that can <i>teleport</i>. <br /> <br /> The whole series is amazing. Isaac and Hector (poor puppy) are excellent looks at Demon Summoners working for powerful dynasties. Dracula and the Vampire Nobles are prime Deathlord/Abyssal relations and politics. Saint-Germain is a great look at how a Mortal Sorcerer might fare in a world defined by badassery. Isaac and FlysEyes discussion on the nature of sin is a legitimately bone-chilling social combat scene (<i>I was a scholar, in a place called Athens....) </i><br /> <br /> I strongly recommend giving it a watch if you haven't.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Please be warned: this is not champagne, this is most likely a duck.<br /> -<i>Chausse</i><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#800080\"><i>Message me for Japanese translations.</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8830-sorcerous-overlord","name":"Sorcerous Overlord","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8830_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"873"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-27T21:14:41-07:00","id":1384349,"title":"","content":"Asoka vs Maul from the recent episodes of Clone Wars","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1047-vampire-hunter-d","name":"vampire hunter D","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1047_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date